id":1,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率 ROA > 0","passed":1,"detail":"當期 ROA = 16.9%"},{"id":2,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"營業現金流 CFO > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $2,012M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":0,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 20.3%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"流動比率 = 0.47"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":60.38,"default_fair_val":60.38,"premium_pct":93.1,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":25.8,"pe_forward":22.7,"pb_trailing":5.5,"pb_forward":5,"div_yield":0.61,"ps_ratio":6.6,"fcf_to_ev":3.67,"fcf_to_mcap":3.8,"liab_to_assets":20.3,"cash_to_assets":0.8,"current_ratio":0.47,"roe":21.2,"roa":16.9,"moat":{"ticker":"WPM","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"WPM 作為貴金屬 ખરીદ (streaming) 與融資的領導者，其品牌價值體現在與礦業公司建立的長期穩固關係，以及其在行業內的信譽。然而，其產品（黃金、白銀等）本質上是商品，缺乏獨特的品牌溢價能力，定價權受市場供需影響較大。相較於消費品牌，其品牌壁壘相對較弱，但其專業性和可靠性在行業內建立了良好的聲譽，能吸引優質礦企合作，這是一種無形的品牌資產，但非直接的定價權。","comment_en":"WPM, as a leader in precious metals streaming and financing, derives brand value from its long-standing, stable relationships with mining companies and its reputation within the industry. However, its products (gold, silver, etc.) are essentially commodities, lacking unique brand premium capabilities, and its pricing power is significantly influenced by market supply and demand. Compared to consumer brands, its brand barrier is relatively weaker. Nevertheless, its professionalism and reliability have established a good reputation in the industry, attracting high-quality mining companies for cooperation, which is an intangible brand asset, but not direct pricing power."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"WPM 的業務模式主要基於合約與金融安排，而非依賴專利或技術創新來建立壁壘。其營運受貴金屬市場監管、礦業開採的環保法規及各國金融政策影響。雖然這些監管環境可能對新進入者構成一定的障礙，但並非 WPM 獨有的專利或特許權，其競爭優勢不在此。公司需持續遵守不斷變化的法規，這更多是營運成本而非護城河。","comment_en":"WPM's business model is primarily based on contracts and financial arrangements, rather than relying on patents or technological innovation for barriers. Its operations are influenced by precious metals market regulations, environmental laws for mining, and financial policies of various countries. While these regulatory environments may pose some obstacles to new entrants, they are not unique patents or licenses exclusive to WPM, and its competitive advantage does not lie here. The company must continuously comply with evolving regulations, which represent operational costs rather than a moat."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"WPM 與礦業公司的合約關係具有一定的黏性。一旦礦業公司選擇了 WPM 的 ખરીદ (streaming) 或融資模式，更換合作夥伴的過程可能涉及複雜的合約條款、重新談判以及潛在的法律成本。對於礦業公司而言，尋找替代的 ખરીદ (streaming) 夥伴需要時間和資源，且可能影響其營運資金的穩定性。然而，這並非絕對的轉換成本，若有更優厚的條件，礦業公司仍可能尋求變更。","comment_en":"WPM's contractual relationships with mining companies possess a degree of stickiness. Once a mining company opts for WPM's streaming or financing model, the process of changing partners may involve complex contractual terms, renegotiations, and potential legal costs. For mining companies, finding alternative streaming partners requires time and resources and could affect the stability of their operating capital. However, these are not absolute switching costs; mining companies might still seek changes if more favorable terms are available."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"WPM 的業務模式不涉及典型的網絡效應。其價值主要來自於與個別礦業公司的獨特合約和對其資產的評估能力，而非用戶數量增加帶來的邊際效益遞增。客戶（礦業公司）之間不存在顯著的協同效應，公司也無法從更多客戶的加入中獲得指數級的競爭優勢。因此，網絡效應在此幾乎不存在。","comment_en":"WPM's business model does not involve typical network effects. Its value primarily stems from unique contracts with individual mining companies and its ability to assess their assets, rather than increasing marginal benefits derived from a growing user base. There are no significant synergistic effects among its clients (mining companies), nor does the company gain an exponential competitive advantage from the addition of more clients. Therefore, network effects are virtually non-existent here."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"WPM 作為全球最大的貴金屬 ખરીદ (streaming) 公司之一，其規模帶來了顯著的成本優勢。龐大的交易量使其能夠獲得更優惠的融資條件，並在盡職調查、合約談判和風險管理方面積累了豐富的經驗和專業知識，降低了單筆交易的營運成本。這種規模效應使其能與更多、更廣泛的礦業公司合作，並在交易條款上保持競爭力，形成了一定的成本壁壘。","comment_en":"As one of the world's largest precious metals streaming companies, WPM's scale provides significant cost advantages. Its substantial transaction volume allows it to secure more favorable financing terms and accumulate extensive experience and expertise in due diligence, contract negotiation, and risk management, thereby reducing the operational costs per transaction. This economies of scale enable it to partner with a wider range of mining companies and maintain competitive terms, forming a certain cost barrier."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"WPM 的核心競爭力在於其在全球範圍內識別、評估和獲取優質礦產資源 ખરીદ (streaming) 權的能力。公司專注於投資於具有長期穩健產出預期的礦山，並透過多元化的地理佈局來分散風險。雖然礦產資源本身並非 WPM 獨有，但其篩選、談判和建立長期合作關係的能力，使其能夠獲取在特定地理位置的、具有吸引力的 ખરીદ (streaming) 資產，這構成了一種獨特的優勢。","comment_en":"WPM's core competency lies in its ability to identify, evaluate, and acquire streaming rights to high-quality mineral resources globally. The company focuses on investing in mines with long-term, stable production expectations and diversifies risk through geographical distribution. While mineral resources themselves are not unique to WPM, its ability to screen, negotiate, and establish long-term partnerships allows it to secure attractive streaming assets in specific geographical locations, constituting a unique advantage."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"WPM 在其 ખરીદ (streaming) 和融資業務中展現了高度的營運效率。公司擁有專業的團隊來評估礦山的技術、經濟和環境可行性，並能有效管理合約條款和現金流。其專注於貴金屬 ખરીદ (streaming) 的業務模式，使其能夠在風險管理和成本控制方面形成專業壁壘。相較於傳統的礦業公司，WPM 的輕資產模式減少了直接的勘探和開採風險，提高了資本效率。","comment_en":"WPM demonstrates high operational efficiency in its streaming and financing business. The company employs specialized teams to assess the technical, economic, and environmental feasibility of mines and effectively manages contractual terms and cash flows. Its business model, focused on precious metals streaming, allows it to build professional barriers in risk management and cost control. Compared to traditional mining companies, WPM's asset-light model reduces direct exploration and extraction risks, enhancing capital efficiency."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"WPM 的管理層在資本配置方面表現出色。公司專注於將資本投入到具有吸引力回報的 ખરીદ (streaming) 和權利金協議中，並嚴格控制風險。其穩健的資產負債表和持續的自由現金流生成能力，使其能夠在擴張業務的同時，維持較低的債務水平。管理層展現了將資本有效配置於能產生長期價值的資產的能力，並在股息支付和股票回購之間取得平衡，體現了卓越的資本配置智慧。","comment_en":"WPM's management excels in capital allocation. The company focuses on deploying capital into attractive streaming and royalty agreements, rigorously managing risks. Its solid balance sheet and consistent free cash flow generation enable business expansion while maintaining low debt levels. Management demonstrates the ability to effectively allocate capital to assets that generate long-term value and balances dividend payments with share repurchases, reflecting excellent capital allocation acumen."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"WPM 與其供應商（礦業公司）之間建立了長期且互利的合作關係，這有助於提高客戶黏性。一旦礦業公司與 WPM 簽訂了 ખરીદ (streaming) 合約，通常意味著 WPM 將在礦山剩餘經濟壽命內持續購買其產出，這為礦業公司提供了穩定的收入來源和融資支持。這種長期承諾和對礦業公司財務健康的貢獻，使得 WPM 成為礦業公司尋求合作時的優先選擇，從而提高了客戶留存率。","comment_en":"WPM has established long-term, mutually beneficial partnerships with its suppliers (mining companies), which contributes to customer retention. Once a mining company signs a streaming contract with WPM, it typically means WPM will continuously purchase its output for the mine's remaining economic life, providing a stable revenue stream and financing support for the mining company. This long-term commitment and contribution to the mining company's financial health make WPM a preferred partner when mining companies seek collaboration, thereby increasing customer retention."},"m10_durability":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"WPM 的 ખરીદ (streaming) 業務模式具有顯著的持久性。它透過購買未來產出權來獲利，而非直接擁有和營運礦山，這使其免受許多與採礦相關的運營風險和資本支出壓力。只要全球對黃金、白銀等貴金屬有持續需求，WPM 的業務就能持續。其合約結構通常較長，且能從礦山生命週期中獲利，使其能夠在經濟週期波動中保持相對穩定，展現了良好的業務持久性。","comment_en":"WPM's streaming business model possesses significant durability. By purchasing the rights to future production rather than directly owning and operating mines, it is shielded from many operational risks and capital expenditure pressures associated with mining. As long as there is sustained global demand for precious metals like gold and silver, WPM's business can continue. Its contract structures are typically long-term, allowing it to profit from the mine's lifecycle, enabling it to remain relatively stable amidst economic cycles, demonstrating good business durability."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"WPM 展現了強勁的經濟護城河，尤其在規模成本（M5）、營運效率（M7）和資本配置（M8）方面得分很高。其 ખરીદ (streaming) 業務模式是一種獨特的金融工具，使其能以輕資產方式獲取全球優質礦產資源的現金流，類似於一種「收費橋」模式，從貴金屬的生產中穩定獲利。雖然缺乏專利（M2）和網絡效應（M4），但其品牌聲譽（M1）、合約黏性（M3）、獨特資產獲取能力（M6）及業務持久性（M10）共同構建了堅實的競爭壁壘。管理層卓越的資本配置能力是其價值的關鍵驅動因素。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"WPM exhibits a strong economic moat, scoring particularly high in cost advantages from scale (M5), operational efficiency (M7), and capital allocation (M8). Its streaming business model is a unique financial tool, enabling it to acquire cash flows from high-quality global mineral resources in an asset-light manner, akin to a 'toll bridge' model, generating stable profits from precious metal production. While lacking patents (M2) and network effects (M4), its brand reputation (M1), contractual stickiness (M3), unique asset acquisition capabilities (M6), and business durability (M10) collectively form a solid competitive barrier. Management's excellent capital allocation is a key driver of its value.","evidenceHash":"ac77ed09775ac258467c0d9751a270e7154edbb4a757dab6f792da1d6a3332fd","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":7,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"superRobust","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-31T06:51:39.623Z","evidenceHash":"eb021cd15379e366f85a9900061388b6a93ad7e16a1b7816c1af79b55a48267d"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"highRisk","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-31T06:51:39.623Z","evidenceHash":"eb021cd15379e366f85a9900061388b6a93ad7e16a1b7816c1af79b55a48267d"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/WPM.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/WPM.png","website":"https://www.wheatonpm.com","ceo":"Haytham Henry Hodaly","full_time_employees":"44","description":"Wheaton Precious Metals Corp. functions as a streaming enterprise, primarily engaged in the global distribution of valuable metals. Its offerings encompass deposits of gold, silver, palladium, and cobalt. The company maintains a substantial portfolio, holding stakes in 23 operational mines and an additional 13 development ventures. Founded in 2004, the firm's headquarters are located in Vancouver, Canada. It operated under the name Silver Wheaton Corp. until May 2017, when it rebranded to its current title.","description_en":"Wheaton Precious Metals Corp. functions as a streaming enterprise, primarily engaged in the global distribution of valuable metals. Its offerings encompass deposits of gold, silver, palladium, and cobalt. The company maintains a substantial portfolio, holding stakes in 23 operational mines and an additional 13 development ventures. Founded in 2004, the firm's headquarters are located in Vancouver, Canada. It operated under the name Silver Wheaton Corp. until May 2017, when it rebranded to its current title.","description_zh":"Wheaton Precious Metals Corp.（美股代碼：WPM）為 Basic Materials 領域之重要企業，專注於 Gold 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"Suite 3500 - 1021 West Hastings Street","city":"Vancouver","state":"BC","zip":"V6E 0C3","country":"CA","phone":"16046849648","full_address":"Suite 3500 - 1021 West Hastings Street, Vancouver, BC V6E 0C3, CA","range_52w":"94.28-165.76","year_high":165.76,"year_low":94.28,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":94.28,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[],"stock_splits":[],"fmp_symbol":"WPM","real_5y_prices":[],"historical_dcf_series":[],"name_en":"Wheaton Precious Metals Corp.","expansion":{"status":"available","capturedAt":"2026-10-31T06:51:39.623Z","reason":null,"detailPath":"cache/us_companies/WPM.json"},"z_score":68.09,"z_score_model":"z","z_score_zone":"superRobust","z_score_breakdown":[{"id":1,"key":"x1","category":"營運資金","desc":"營運資金 / 總資產 (X1)","desc_en":"Working capital / Total assets (X1)","weight":1.2,"value":0.1144451193105117,"contribution":0.13733414317261403,"passed":null,"detail":"0.1144 × 1.2 = 0.1373","detail_zh":"0.1144 × 1.2 = 0.1373","detail_en":"0.1144 × 1.2 = 0.1373","reason":null},{"id":2,"key":"x2","category":"保留盈餘","desc":"保留盈餘 / 總資產 (X2)","desc_en":"Retained earnings / Total assets (X2)","weight":1.4,"value":0.5123878197481391,"contribution":0.7173429476473947,"passed":null,"detail":"0.5124 × 1.4 = 0.7173","detail_zh":"0.5124 × 1.4 = 0.7173","detail_en":"0.5124 × 1.4 = 0.7173","reason":null},{"id":3,"key":"x3","category":"獲利能力","desc":"EBIT / 總資產 (X3)","desc_en":"EBIT / Total assets (X3)","weight":3.3,"value":0.18939821555706035,"contribution":0.6250141113382991,"passed":null,"d